    "title": "Trump Sets Record-Low Refugee Cap of 7,500 for 2026, Prioritizing White South Africans - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Terry Anderson ,\n19 days ago President Donald Trump has set the U.S. refugee admissions ceiling at 7,500 for the 2026 fiscal year—the lowest cap in U.S. history, according to a policy document released by the White House on Thursday. The administration says it will focus refugee admissions primarily on white South Africans from the country’s Afrikaner minority, citing what Trump describes as “racial persecution.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
